{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ToneFit 是一款專為追求時尚與美感的用戶設計的智能色彩分析工具，能精準找出最適合你的膚色配色方案。這款 App 現正限時免費下載，原價為 US $0.99，讓你能夠輕鬆建立個人專屬的色彩資料庫，提升日常穿搭與造型的整體協調度。</p>\n\n<h2>智能膚色測試與搭配</h2>\n<p>ToneFit 採用兩步式皮膚色調測試，只需拍攝手腕與面部照片，即可分析冷、暖或中性底調並生成個人色彩檔案。App 提供針對不同場合調整的專屬調色板，並支援掃描現有衣物以評估匹配度。此外，你還可並排比較兩種顏色以獲取清晰建議，所有數據均在裝置本地處理，確保隱私安全且無需註冊帳號。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1170x2532bb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1170x2532bb-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1170x2532bb-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1170x2532bb-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1170x2532bb-4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1170x2532bb-5.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ToneFit: Color Analysis</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T15:18:55.525470+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}